   },
   "evidence": "The throwaway probe invoked HEAD's updateWorker with injected git, installation and exec operations, tracking checkout and dependency state independently. HEAD runs `await run([process.execPath, \"install\", \"--frozen-lockfile\"])` before checking `process.execve`; its catch restores only with `git checkout --detach original`. Neither failure path reinstalls the original dependencies. This updater did not exist at base."
