   },
   "evidence": "update.ts:29-33 runs `git checkout --detach target`, then `bun install --frozen-lockfile`, and only then `const exec = options.exec ?? process.execve; if (!exec) throw ...`. The catch block (35-46) only restores HEAD; nothing reinstalls node_modules. In Bun 1.4.3 `typeof process.execve` is 'function', so the missing-exec branch is unlikely. A partial or failed install is the realistic trigger."
  }
